blurb = "Depicts the fictional ninja [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsunade]Tsunade[/url] holding a dagger, standing her ground against an enormous, hissing serpent coiled around a standing screen.

Tsunade is from the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiraiya]Jiraiya Gōketsu Monogatari[/url] (The Tale of the Gallant Jiraiya). She is the wife of Jiraiya, a legendary ninja who commands giant frogs, and she herself uses snail-related magic."
